'''Nidhögg the Bleeding''' is the upgraded form of [[Nidhögg]] using the [[Bloodstone]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing ''(not to be confused with health percentage)''.

* The primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit. No damage penalty against multiple targets.
* Its secondary attack deals 3x damage with a slightly longer reach.

An upgraded Nidhögg will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Nidhögg the Bleeding.

